#: src/chrome/components/site-footer/site-footer.tsx
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: src/how-to-play/components/how-to-play-page/how-to-play-page.tsx
msgid "After that, look at a single blank cell and cross off every digit that already appears in its row, its column and its box. If only one digit survives, that is a <0>naked single</0>, and it can be placed immediately. If a cell still has several candidates left, check whether one of those candidates cannot go anywhere else in the same unit — that is a <1>hidden single</1>, and it is just as safe to place. Together these two patterns solve most of an easy puzzle without any deeper reasoning."
msgstr "接下来，看某一个空格，划掉它所在行、列和宫中已经出现的每个数字。如果只剩下一个数字，那就是<0>显性单数</0>，可以立刻填入。如果一个格子仍有多个候选数字，就检查其中某个候选数字在同一单元的其他位置是否都不能填，那就是<1>隐性单数</1>，同样可以放心填入。这两种模式合起来，不需要更深的推理就能解出大部分简单数独。"

#: src/printable/components/printable-easy-sudoku-page/printable-easy-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Also the source tier for the large-print PDF, sampled at {PRINTABLE_LARGE_PRINT_SIZE} puzzles."
msgstr "同时也是大字号 PDF 的来源档位，抽样 {PRINTABLE_LARGE_PRINT_SIZE} 道题。"

#: src/difficulty/components/hard-sudoku-page/hard-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "An almost-fish: the rows or columns line up as an X-Wing or <0>swordfish</0> except for one or two extra candidates, the fin. The elimination still holds, but only in the cells that both the fish and the fin can see."
msgstr "近似的鱼形：行或列排成 X-Wing 或 <0>Swordfish</0> 的样子，只是多出一两个候选数字，也就是鳍。排除仍然成立，但只限于鱼形和鳍都能看到的格子。"

