msgstr "困难数独"

#: src/difficulty/components/hard-sudoku-page/hard-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Hard Sudoku FAQ"
msgstr "困难数独常见问题"

#: src/difficulty/components/hard-sudoku-page/hard-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Hard Sudoku is a difficulty tier that starts at {clueCount} clues out of 81 cells and is defined by what a subset-only solver cannot finish: every board in the tier has been run through a solver equipped with every intersection and every subset up to the <0>hidden quad</0>, and kept only because that solver got stuck. What breaks the deadlock is a fish — <1>X-Wing</1>, <2>swordfish</2>, <3>jellyfish</3> and their <4>finned</4> and <5>sashimi</5> variants — or a wing: <6>XY-Wing</6>, <7>XYZ-Wing</7> and <8>W-Wing</8>."
msgstr "困难数独是一个从 81 格中 {clueCount} 个已知数字起步的难度档位，其定义是只用数组的解题器解不出来：这一档的每个盘面都用掌握所有交叉区块和直到<0>隐性四数组</0>的所有数组的解题器试过，只因该解题器卡住才被保留。打破僵局的是鱼形：<1>X-Wing</1>、<2>Swordfish</2>、<3>Jellyfish</3> 及其 <4>Finned</4> 和 <5>Sashimi</5> 变体；或者翼形：<6>XY-Wing</6>、<7>XYZ-Wing</7> 和 <8>W-Wing</8>。"

#: src/difficulty/components/difficulty-navigation/difficulty-navigation.tsx
msgid "Harder difficulty"
msgstr "较困难的难度"

#: src/difficulty/components/infinity-sudoku-page/infinity-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Harder than anything else in the app, by a wide margin. Our sample of {sampleSize} <0>Hell</0> boards measures SE {hellSeRatingRange}; Infinity starts at {lowestRatingLabel}. The Infinity ratings are not our own measurements. Suuudokuuu’s rater prices the SE ladder only as far as forcing chains and nets and reports {SE_RATING_CEILING} with a ceiling flag above that, so for these puzzles we quote the figures independent raters publish, as the <1>difficulty rating guide</1> explains."
msgstr "比应用里的其他任何档位都难得多。我们的 {sampleSize} 道<0>地狱</0>盘面样本测得 SE {hellSeRatingRange}；无限从 {lowestRatingLabel} 开始。无限的评级不是我们自己测得的。Suuudokuuu 的评级器只对 SE 阶梯计价到强制链和强制网为止，超过之后就报告 {SE_RATING_CEILING} 并附带上限标记，所以对这些题目，我们引用其他独立评级者公布的数字，详见<1>难度评级指南</1>。"

