#: src/printable/components/printable-medium-sudoku-page/printable-medium-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Print space here matters more than at the easier tiers, because intersections and pairs work by marking candidates in the margins. The {PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_SIZE} puzzles print {PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_PUZZLES_PER_PAGE} to a page at full cell size, leaving enough room around each digit to pencil in the small numbers an intersection or a pair reasons over. Solved grids close out the file so you can check your candidate marks against a confirmed answer. Our published sample of {sampleSize} Medium boards measures SE {seRatingRange} — numbers the <0>sudoku difficulty rating guide</0> measures directly rather than assumes."
msgstr "这里的打印空间比较简单的档位更重要，因为交叉区块和数对要靠在页边标记候选数字。{PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_SIZE} 道题以完整格子尺寸每页打印 {PRINTABLE_BOOKLET_PUZZLES_PER_PAGE} 道，每个数字周围留有足够空间，可以用铅笔写下交叉区块或数对所依据的小数字。答案盘面附在文件末尾，让你能对照已确认的答案检查自己的候选数字标记。我们公布的 {sampleSize} 道中等盘面样本测得 SE {seRatingRange}，这些数字由<0>数独难度评级指南</0>直接测得，而不是凭空假设。"

