#: src/home/components/home-page/home-page.tsx
msgid "Seven difficulty levels from Newbie through Hell to Infinity, the top tier serving record puzzles such as Everest and AI Escargot"
msgstr "从新手经过地狱到无限共七个难度等级，最高一档提供 Everest 和 AI Escargot 等纪录级题目"

#: src/home/components/home-page/home-page.tsx
msgid "Seven: Newbie, Easy, Medium, Hard, Nightmare, Hell and Infinity. Hell puzzles come from a bundled, verified corpus of boards that each need a forcing chain, beyond anything Nightmare asks for, and <0>Infinity</0> serves record puzzles such as Everest and AI Escargot."
msgstr "七个：新手、简单、中等、困难、噩梦、地狱和无限。地狱题取自内置的已验证题库，每道题都需要强制链，超出噩梦的要求；<0>无限</0>提供 Everest 和 AI Escargot 等纪录级题目。"

#: src/difficulty/components/sudoku-difficulties-page/sudoku-difficulties-page.tsx
msgid "Seven. Newbie, Easy, Medium, Hard, Nightmare and Hell form the technique ladder, each defined by a clue count and a guaranteed technique band rather than a marketing label. Infinity sits above them, a curated set of record puzzles chosen by published rating."
msgstr "七个。新手、简单、中等、困难、噩梦和地狱组成技巧阶梯，每一档都由已知数字的多少和有保证的技巧区间定义，而不是营销标签。无限位于它们之上，是按公布的评级挑选的一组纪录级题目。"

#: src/home/components/home-page/home-page.tsx
msgid "Shareable puzzle links and full game replays for any solve"
msgstr "任何一局都可以生成可分享的题目链接和完整的对局回放"

#: src/difficulty/components/nightmare-sudoku-page/nightmare-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Size and shape. A wing is a fixed pattern of three or four cells you learn to recognise at a glance; a chain is built link by link and can run to any length, which is why chains sit a full band above wings on the SE scale."
msgstr "大小和形状。翼形是由三四个格子组成的固定图案，学会之后一眼就能认出；链则是一环一环搭建的，可以任意长，所以在 SE 量表上，链比翼形整整高出一个档位。"

